    glob_imported_private_fn_lowers_to_unmangled_extern_2026-09-13, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep5: interpreter leg reproduced (two same-dir private _helper defs glob-imported: runs R=2 permissively per the doc's same-dir exception); the native leg no longer emits an unmangled extern on the current seed (binds module-mangled), but the fabrication path was still live for the every-resolver-misses shape. Root cause: a glob-imported private name reaching codegen with no resolving map entry was fabricated as declare_function(name, Import) under the RAW BARE NAME (cranelift calls.rs fabricate branch; LLVM mangle.rs/resolve_call_target then codegen/llvm/functions.rs mirrors it); glob bindings skip _ private names and ambiguous privates get no first-wins fallback, so every definition is module-mangled; data-globals already fail closed on this exact condition but calls had no twin. Fix: hard error in the fabricate branch (cranelift) + reject_leaked_ambiguous_private_call_targets after mangle_mir (LLVM leg), firing only when unresolved + _-prefixed + ambiguous; 6 new unit tests (incl negative fabricate/ambiguous/public/runtime/extern cases); cargo ambiguous_private/reject_leaked 6 passed, surrounding suites 445 passed / 3 pre-existing env failures. Spec glob_private_fn_unmangled_extern_native_spec added (validated up to the concurrent SPL-PAT-001 rollout queue blocking the driver - documented in the spec header). Enabling fixes for that queue (not my bug, PR #12267 fallout): collection_opt_core.spl local_id_or_invalid/local_or_nil, link.spl unify_hints, resolve.spl build_trait_impls per the diagnostic's prescription. Residuals: pure-Simple leg has the same leak class (core_codegen.spl unknown_func_decls) - needs a self-hosted build to confirm and fence; interpreter same-dir glob permissive leg remains per the doc's staged-rollout deferral; LLVM-leg guard unit-tested only (no llvm feature on this host). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/backend/glob_private_fn_unmangled_extern_native_spec.spl prevention=src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/pipeline/native_project/mangle.rs"

